    'Vitamin E je snažan antioksidans koji je vrlo popularan u uljima za lice jer doprinosi osjećaju mekoće, elastičnosti i pomaže koži da izgleda zdravije. U praksi, to znači manje suhog dojma i više ugodnog, njegovanog osjećaja.' => 'Vitamin E is a powerful antioxidant that is very popular in facial oils because it helps skin feel soft and supple and look healthier. In practice, that means less of a dry appearance and more of a comfortable, cared for feeling.',
