    'Indonesian Rupiah' => 'Indonesian Rupiah',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Upoznaj jedan proizvod” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Primjer s Aloe Lipsom, za osobu s kojom si već razgovarala o njezi suhih usana. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], evo ti Aloe Lips o kojem smo pričale. To je balzam za njegu suhih usana, a nanosiš ga po potrebi. Javi mi ako želiš još nešto znati, rado ću ti objasniti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš tri provjerene informacije napisane svojim riječima i znaš gdje ih ponovno pronaći.' => 'Help the member with “Get to know one product” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: An Aloe Lips example for someone you have already spoken with about caring for dry lips. Example tone: “Hi [ime], here\'s the Aloe Lips we talked about. It\'s a balm for caring for dry lips, and you can apply it as needed. Let me know if you\'d like to know anything else. I\'ll be happy to explain.” Use the warmth and style, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add personal experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion criteria still apply: You have three verified pieces of information written in your own words, and you know where to find them again.',
