    'You receive your Forever Card App when you become a registered Forever business partner and your sponsor is within our team. After access is granted, you follow a simple onboarding process that shows you how to activate and set up your personal app. Your app is your digital base: you choose which blocks to display (for example video, products, AI advisor, contact, education) and you can set everything up without technical skills. If you also work offline, you receive a free NFC card delivered to your address, which opens your app with a quick tap/scan.' => 'You receive your Forever Card App when you become a registered Forever business partner and your sponsor is within our team. After access is granted, you follow a simple onboarding process that shows you how to activate and set up your personal app. Your app is your digital base: you choose which blocks to display (for example video, products, AI advisor, contact, education) and you can set everything up without technical skills. If you also work offline, you receive a free NFC card delivered to your address, which opens your app with a quick tap/scan.',
