    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Napiši kratku uputu u tri koraka” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Kratka uputa kupcu koji ne zna gdje provjeriti podatke u webshopu. Primjer tona: „Pokazat ću ti, ide ovako: prvo odaberi svoju zemlju, zatim otvori proizvod pa pročitaj uputu. Prije plaćanja pogledaj i dostavu da vidiš ukupan iznos. Ako negdje zapneš, javi.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš spremljenu uputu od tri provjerene točke i izvor informacija.' => 'Help the member with “Write a short guide in three steps” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A short guide for a customer who does not know where to check information in the online shop. Example tone: “I’ll show you. Here’s how: first choose your country, then open the product and read the instructions. Before paying, check delivery too so you can see the total amount. Let me know if you get stuck.” Use the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: You have saved a guide with three verified points and the source of the information.',
