    'Angola' => 'Angola',
    'Kad se kosa tek počinje stanjivati, preporuka može ostati nježnija: aloe baza iznutra, kolagen kao support i lagana rutina vlasišta.' => 'When hair is just beginning to thin, the recommendation can stay gentler: an aloe foundation taken internally, collagen for support and a light scalp care routine.',
