    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pripremi odgovor na često pitanje” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Kupcu koji pita kako se proizvod koristi; dopuni stvarnu uputu. Primjer tona: „Naravno, pokazat ću ti. [Opiši korištenje prema uputi svojim riječima.] Šaljem ti i uputu da je imaš pri ruci. Ako te neki dio zbuni, javi mi.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš jedan provjeren odgovor, sačuvan izvor i datum provjere.' => 'Help the member with “Prepare an answer to a frequently asked question” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A customer asks how to use a product; fill in the actual instructions. Example tone: “Of course, I\'ll show you. [Describe how to use it in your own words, following the instructions.] I\'ll send you the instructions too, so you have them handy. If anything is unclear, let me know.” Adopt the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have one verified answer, a saved source and the date it was checked.',
