    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pomozi suradniku da sam napiše poruku” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Suradniku koji je zatražio pomoć oko pisanja poruke. Primjer tona: „Ajde mi prvo reci kome pišeš i što bi toj osobi rekla da sada sjedi kraj tebe. Napiši tako, svojim riječima, pa ćemo zajedno pogledati treba li što dotjerati.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš pripremljena pitanja koja osobi pomažu napisati vlastitu poruku. Vježbu tako i označi.' => 'Help the member with “Help a member write their own message” as though you\'re going through their day together. Example situation: A member who has asked for help writing a message. Example tone: “First, tell me who you\'re writing to and what you\'d say if they were sitting beside you right now. Write it like that, in your own words, and then we\'ll look together at whether anything needs polishing.” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but don\'t borrow someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, don\'t add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have prepared questions that help the person write their own message. Mark it as a practice exercise.',
