    'Prefilled amount' => 'Prefilled amount',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Dovrši jednu obećanu pomoć” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Kupcu kojem si obećala provjeriti status problema. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], da te ne ostavim bez informacije: sada je [stvarni status]. Još čekam [što nedostaje]. Čim dobijem odgovor, javim ti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Napravio si svoju dogovorenu radnju i upisao stvarni status problema.' => 'Help the member with “Follow through on one offer of help” as though you were going through their day together. Example situation: A customer you promised to update on the status of an issue. Example tone: “Hi [name], I don’t want to leave you without an update: the current status is [actual status]. I’m still waiting for [what is missing]. I’ll let you know as soon as I get a reply.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms that they have used it themselves and are satisfied, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You took the action you agreed to take and recorded the issue’s actual status.',
