    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Uredi jedan nejasan dio kartice” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Tvoja bilješka za uređivanje kartice. Primjer tona: „Na gumbu piše samo „Klikni ovdje”. Promijenit ću u „Pogledaj proizvode”, da se odmah zna što će se otvoriti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Jedan je dio kartice jasniji ili si pripremio točan opis izmjene za zaključani dio.' => 'Help the member with “Edit one unclear part of the card” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: Your note about editing the card. Example tone: “The button just says ‘Click here’. I\'ll change it to ‘View products’ so it\'s immediately clear what will open.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used the product themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add personal experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: One part of the card is clearer, or you have prepared an exact description of the change for a locked section.',
