    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pomozi suradniku odabrati sljedeći korak” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Suradniku kojem pomažeš odabrati vlastiti sljedeći korak. Primjer tona: „Ajmo od onoga što ti je sad najlakše. Što bi prvo probala? Ako te jedan dio koči, proći ćemo ga zajedno, a onda pokušaj svojim tempom.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Pružio si jednu dogovorenu pomoć ili napravio označenu vježbu, bez upisivanja tuđeg završetka.' => 'Help the member with “Help a member choose their next step” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A member you are helping choose their own next step. Example tone: “Let’s start with what feels easiest for you right now. What would you like to try first? If one part is holding you back, we can go through it together, then you can try at your own pace.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have provided one agreed form of help or done an exercise marked as practice, without recording someone else’s completion.',
