    'Korisnik: "Što biste preporučili za probavu i jednostavnu dnevnu rutinu?"' => 'User: "What would you recommend for digestion and a simple daily routine?"',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Poveži 4 Core sa svojim danom” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Tvoj primjer za pamćenje četiri područja. Primjer tona: „Meni je 4 Core najlakše zapamtiti ovako: preporučujem proizvod, pomažem kupcu, pričam s nekim o poslu i učim nešto što ću moći primijeniti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Razvrstao si četiri primjera i odabrao jedno područje za dalje, bez pripisivanja izmišljenih rezultata.' => 'Help the member with “Connect 4 Core to your day” as though you were going through their day together. Example situation: Your example for remembering the four areas. Example tone: “The easiest way for me to remember 4 Core is this: I recommend a product, help a customer, talk to someone about the business and learn something I can put into practice.” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have sorted four examples and chosen one area to focus on next, without claiming results that didn\'t happen.',
    'The start of a Sonya routine' => 'The start of a Sonya routine',
    'Forever Arctic Sea dodatak prehrani s omega 3 masnim kiselinama EPA i DHA za zdravlje srca i mozga.' => 'Forever Arctic Sea dietary supplement with omega 3 fatty acids EPA and DHA for heart and brain health.',
