    'Sunscreen' => 'Sunscreen',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pojednostavni svoju preporuku” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Kada skraćuješ raniju preporuku prema stvarnoj potrebi kupca. Primjer tona: „Znaš što, ne bih te zatrpavala s više stvari. Za početak pogledaj [proizvod], zbog [konkretan razlog]. Ako ti odgovara, mogu ti pokazati kako se koristi, a ostalo ostavimo za kasnije.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš jednostavniju preporuku s jasnim razlogom i provjerenim izvorom.' => 'Help the member with “Simplify your recommendation” as though you were going through their day together. Example situation: When shortening an earlier recommendation to match the customer\'s actual need. Example tone: “You know what, I wouldn\'t overwhelm you with too many things. To start, take a look at [product], because of [specific reason]. If it seems right for you, I can show you how to use it, and we can leave the rest for later.” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have a simpler recommendation with a clear reason and a verified source.',
