    'Ako liječnik ili ljekarnik potvrdi da se rutina uklapa uz terapiju, mapped Forever support smjer ovdje i dalje ostaje unutar ovog opreznog okvira:' => 'If a doctor or pharmacist confirms that the routine is compatible with the therapy, the mapped Forever support direction here still remains within this cautious framework:',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Javi se novom kupcu” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Dobrodošlica novom kupcu koji očekuje tvoju pomoć. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], baš mi je drago da si se javila! Šaljem ti i upute za [proizvod]: [izvor]. Kad stigne, slobodno piši ako te nešto zanima oko korištenja — ne moraš sve sama tražiti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Poruka je poslana ili si napravio vježbu ako nema kupca. Termin upiši tek kad ga dogovorite.' => 'Help the member with “Contact a new customer” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: Welcoming a new customer who expects your help. Example tone: “Hi [ime], I\'m so glad you got in touch! I\'m also sending you the instructions for [proizvod]: [izvor]. When it arrives, feel free to message me if you have any questions about using it. You don\'t have to find everything on your own.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used the product themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add personal experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: The message has been sent, or you have done a practice exercise if you do not have a customer. Record a time only once you have agreed on it.',
