    'Bioaktivna baza: aloe vera i bio celuloza' => 'Bioactive base: aloe vera and bio cellulose',
    'Za visoki tlak neću odabrati jedan Forever proizvod kao terapiju. Za korisnu neutralnu usporedbu napišite koje lijekove uzimate te imate li bolest srca, bubrega ili jetre. Nakon toga mogu usporediti deklaracije Forever ARGI+ (L-arginin), Forever Arctic Sea (riblje ulje) i Forever Cardiohealth (koenzim Q10) te izdvojiti samo opciju koja nema očit sukob s navedenim podacima — bez tvrdnje da snižava tlak ili zamjenjuje terapiju.' => 'I will not select a single Forever product as a treatment for high blood pressure. For a useful, neutral comparison, please tell me which medicines you take and whether you have heart, kidney or liver disease. I can then compare the labels of Forever ARGI+ (L-arginine), Forever Arctic Sea (fish oil) and Forever Cardiohealth (coenzyme Q10), and identify only an option that has no obvious conflict with the information you provided, without claiming that it lowers blood pressure or replaces treatment.',
