    'Netko je kliknuo s bloga. Što da pošaljem dalje?' => 'Someone clicked through from the blog. What should I send next?',
    'Razumem, da iščete topikalni serum z vitaminom C za obraz. Forever Vitamin C je v katalogu, vendar njegov trenutni uradni zapis še ni v celoti preverjen za samodejno priporočilo, zato ga brez potrjene deklaracije ne bom predstavil kot izbiro. Če pošljete trenutno deklaracijo embalaže, lahko preverim natančno sestavo ali uporabo.' => 'I understand you\'re looking for a topical vitamin C serum for your face. Forever Vitamin C is in the catalog, but its current official information has not yet been fully verified for an automatic recommendation, so I won\'t present it as an option without a confirmed label. If you send a photo of the current package label, I can check the exact ingredients or directions for use.',
