    'Trenutni vizual izgleda dovoljno raspršeno da boje i naglaske ne treba čuvati po defaultu. AI smije predložiti jasniji reset.' => 'The current design looks scattered enough that the colors and accents do not need to be retained by default. AI may suggest a clearer reset.',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pripremi poziv na nedjeljni webinar” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Poziv osobi koju zanima Forever posao, nakon provjere termina. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], u nedjelju u 19 imamo online predstavljanje Forevera. Ako ti odgovara, pošaljem ti link. Poslije se možemo čuti pa proći što te bude zanimalo.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Poziv s provjerenim terminom je spreman. Slanje i potvrdu dolaska bilježiš zasebno.' => 'Help the member with “Prepare an invitation to the Sunday webinar” as though you are going through their day together. Example situation: An invitation to someone interested in the Forever business, after checking the time. Example tone: “Hi [ime], there’s an online presentation about Forever on Sunday at 19. If that works for you, I’ll send you the link. We can talk afterward and go over anything you’d like to know.” Take the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms that they have personally used the product and are satisfied with it, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: An invitation with a verified time is ready. Record sending it and confirmation of attendance separately.',
