    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pronađi članak koji odgovara na pitanje” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Odgovor osobi koja je pitala za temu članka. Primjer tona: „Evo, mislim da će ti ovaj članak dobro doći za ono što si me pitala: [FCC_LINK]. Posebno pogledaj dio o [tema]. Javi kako ti se čini i treba li još što pojasniti.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Odabrao si članak i napisao uvod. Slanje označi tek kad poruku stvarno pošalješ.' => 'Help the member with “Find an article that answers the question” as though you are going through their day together. Example situation: A reply to someone who asked about the article\'s topic. Example tone: “Here, I think this article will be useful for what you asked me about: [FCC_LINK]. Take a particular look at the part about [topic]. Let me know what you think and whether you\'d like me to clarify anything else.” Take the warmth and manner of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You chose an article and wrote an introduction. Mark it as sent only when you actually send the message.',
