    'Odaberi područje u kojem bi ti idući pokušaj najviše koristio.' => 'Choose the area where another attempt would help you most.',
    'Aktivnost te puni, brzi i teški koraci računaju se po FCC računu i uspoređuju odabrani prozor s neposredno prethodnim jednakim prozorom. Kod uključenih, pokrenutih i dovršenih veliki broj je trajno ukupno stanje, a delta uspoređuje nove događaje u ta dva jednaka prozora. Mjesečni Personal CC i oba 4 CC pokazatelja deduplicirani su po Forever ID-u i računaju se samo za aktualnu FLP strukturu. Službeni 4 CC broji potvrđene FLP360 signale; efektivni koristi službeni 1/0, a samo kada signal nedostaje pomoćnu formulu Personal CC ≥ 1 i inkluzivni Total Active CC ≥ 4.' => 'Activity, easy steps and challenging steps are counted by FCC account and compare the selected window with the immediately preceding window of the same length. For enrolled, started and completed, the large number is the permanent total, while the change compares new events in those two equal windows. Monthly Personal CC and both 4 CC indicators are deduplicated by Forever ID and count only the current FLP structure. Official 4 CC counts confirmed FLP360 signals; effective 4 CC uses the official 1/0 and, only when that signal is missing, the fallback formula of Personal CC ≥ 1 and inclusive Total Active CC ≥ 4.',
    'Gikuyu, Kikuyu' => 'Gikuyu, Kikuyu',
