    'pri iritaciji ili nelagodi kože' => 'when skin feels irritated or uncomfortable',
    'Ova stranica je informativnog karaktera i vodi ju nezavisni Forever poslovni partner,
      član Forever Card Club tima. Stranica nije službena web stranica kompanije
      Forever Living Products. Kupnjom putem ove stranice bit ćete preusmjereni
      na službeni Forever Living Products web shop u vašoj zemlji, gdje vam se
      automatski odobrava maksimalan službeni popust. Proizvodi za njegu kože nisu lijekovi
      i ne služe za dijagnosticiranje, liječenje ili sprječavanje bolesti.' => 'This page is for informational purposes and is run by an independent Forever business partner,
      a member of the Forever Card Club team. This is not the official website of
      Forever Living Products. When you purchase through this page, you will be redirected
      to the official Forever Living Products online store in your country, where you will
      automatically receive the maximum official discount. Skincare products are not medicines
      and are not intended to diagnose, treat or prevent disease.',
    'Apply the AI theme' => 'Apply the AI theme',
    'Po želji dodatno:' => 'Optional extra:',
    'When bloating, poor digestion and low energy show up together, the recommendation should first calm the digestive rhythm and only then add a simple support direction for energy.' => 'When bloating, poor digestion and low energy show up together, the recommendation should first calm the digestive rhythm and only then add a simple support direction for energy.',
    'Sponsor profil' => 'Sponsor profile',
    'Forever Aloe Sunscreen nudi zaštitu širokog spektra označenu SPF 30, što znači da pomaže
      u zaštiti kože od UVA i UVB zračenja. UVA zrake dopiru dublje u kožu i mogu biti povezane
      s prijevremenim starenjem, dok UVB zrake utječu na površinske slojeve kože. Ova kombinirana
      zaštita omogućuje da sigurnije uživaš u suncu tijekom dnevnih aktivnosti.' => 'Forever Aloe Sunscreen offers broad spectrum protection rated SPF 30, which means it helps
      protect the skin from UVA and UVB rays. UVA rays reach deeper into the skin and may be linked
      to premature aging, while UVB rays affect the surface layers of the skin. This combined
      protection lets you enjoy the sun more safely during daily activities.',
    'Upiši broj na koji te Snježana može kontaktirati' => 'Enter a number where Snježana can contact you',
