    'Zbroj glavnog signala' => 'Main signal sum',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pozovi zainteresiranu osobu na razgovor” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Osobni poziv nekome tko želi čuti više o poslu. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], baš bih voljela da se čujemo i prođemo ono što te zanima oko Forevera. Odgovara ti [termin]? Ako ti je lakše, možemo prvo ovdje razmijeniti par poruka.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Poslao si poziv zainteresiranoj osobi. Dolazak označi samo ako ga potvrdi.' => 'Help the member with “Invite an interested person to talk” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A personal invitation to someone who wants to hear more about the business. Example tone: “Hi [name], I’d really like to talk and go over what you’re curious about with Forever. Would [time] work for you? If it’s easier, we can exchange a few messages here first.” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add personal experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You sent an invitation to an interested person. Mark them as having attended only if they confirm it.',
