    'Ova stranica je informativnog karaktera i vodi ju nezavisni Forever poslovni partner, član Forever Card Club tima. Stranica nije službena web stranica kompanije Forever Living Products. Kupnjom putem ove stranice bit ćete preusmjereni na službeni Forever Living Products web shop u vašoj zemlji, gdje vam se automatski odobrava maksimalan službeni popust. Proizvodi za njegu kože nisu lijekovi i ne služe za dijagnosticiranje, liječenje ili sprječavanje bolesti.' => 'This page is for informational purposes and is run by an independent Forever business partner who is a member of the Forever Card Club team. This is not an official Forever Living Products website. When you buy through this page, you will be redirected to the official Forever Living Products online shop in your country, where you will automatically receive the maximum official discount. Skincare products are not medicines and are not intended to diagnose, treat or prevent disease.',
