    'British Pound Sterling' => 'British Pound Sterling',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Javi se kako ste dogovorili” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Nakon stvarno dogovorenog javljanja. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], evo mene kako smo se dogovorili. Jesi stigla pogledati ono što sam ti poslala? Ako ti je nešto ostalo nejasno, možemo proći zajedno.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Javio si se u dogovoreno vrijeme i ažurirao bilješku. Ne moraš dobiti odgovor ni narudžbu.' => 'Help the member with “Follow up as agreed” as though you are going through their day together. Example situation: Following up after you have actually agreed to do so. Example tone: “Hi [ime], I’m getting in touch as we agreed. Have you had a chance to look at what I sent you? If anything is unclear, we can go through it together.” Take the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms that they have personally used the product and are satisfied with it, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: You followed up at the agreed time and updated your note. You do not need to receive a reply or an order.',
    'Za vanjsku rutinu ovdje se najčešće dodaju Forever Aloe Liquid Soap za nježno pranje kože, zatim Forever Aloe First Spray i Aloe Propolis Creme kao dodatna lokalna podrška izvana.' => 'For the topical routine, Forever Aloe Liquid Soap is most often added for gentle skin cleansing, followed by Forever Aloe First Spray and Aloe Propolis Creme for extra topical support.',
    'Funnel mora ostati glavni FCC korak jer najjasnije vodi prema preporuci, prijavi ili ozbiljnom sljedecem potezu.' => 'The funnel must remain the main FCC step because it provides the clearest path toward a recommendation, sign-up or serious next move.',
