    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Dogovori kako ćeš pomoći nakon kupnje” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Nakon kupnje, kada dogovarate pomoć oko korištenja. Primjer tona: „Kad kreneš koristiti [proizvod], slobodno mi piši ako zapneš. Hoćeš da se čujemo [termin] ili ćeš mi se ti javiti kad ti zatreba?” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Pripremio si izbor podrške. Termin je upisan samo ako ste ga stvarno dogovorili.' => 'Help the member with “Agree on how you\'ll help after the purchase” as though you were going through their day together. Example situation: After a purchase, when you are arranging help with using the product. Example tone: “When you start using [product], feel free to message me if you get stuck. Would you like us to talk at [time], or would you rather get in touch when you need help?” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have prepared a choice of support options. A time has been recorded only if you actually agreed on it.',
