    'Old English text generator' => 'Old English text generator',
    'Ovo je radni vrh detalja suradnika. Ovdje prvo vidiš što trenutno radi, gdje zapinje i koji je sljedeći admin potez, bez kopanja po svim donjim blokovima.' => 'This is the working overview of the member\'s details. Here you can first see what they are doing now, where they are getting stuck and the next admin action, without digging through all the sections below.',
