    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pitaj što osobu zanima kod posla” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Za osobu koja je sama pokazala zanimanje za Forever posao. Primjer tona: „Baš mi je drago da te zanima. Što bi voljela prvo čuti — kako izgleda moj dan, kako radim s kupcima ili kako se kreće? Mogu ti pokazati odakle sam ja počela, ako te to zanima.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Poslao si pitanje ili sažeo stvarni razgovor. Osoba se ne mora registrirati da završiš zadatak.' => 'Help the member with “Ask what interests the person about the business” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: For someone who has shown interest in the Forever business on their own initiative. Example tone: “I’m really glad you’re interested. What would you like to hear about first: what my day looks like, how I work with customers or how to get started? I can show you where I began, if you’d like.” Use the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: You sent the question or summarised a real conversation. The person does not have to register for you to complete the task.',
