    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Prepiši odgovor svojim riječima” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Odgovor na praktično pitanje; dopuni ga točnom uputom. Primjer tona: „Naravno, mogu ti pokazati. [Objasni postupak kao uživo.] Probaj tako, a ako ti taj dio i dalje nije jasan, javi mi pa ćemo polako proći zajedno.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš prirodnije napisan, provjeren odgovor. Samo kopiranje AI teksta nije razgovor s kupcem.' => 'Help the member with “Rewrite the answer in your own words” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: An answer to a practical question. Add accurate instructions. Example tone: “Of course, I can show you. [Explain the process as you would in person.] Give it a try, and if that part is still unclear, let me know and we’ll go through it together at your pace.” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have a checked answer written more naturally. Simply copying AI text is not a conversation with a customer.',
