    'Kolagen doprinosi ugodnijem i punijem dojmu kože, dok aloe vera daje osnovu ugode i hidratacije. Ta kombinacija pomaže da koža oko očiju izgleda njegovanije, a šminka bolje sjedne na kožu.' => 'Collagen helps skin feel more comfortable and plump, while aloe vera provides a foundation of comfort and hydration. This combination helps the skin around the eyes look better cared for and makeup sit better on the skin.',
    'We\'ve also generated more than <span class=\'text-primary-400\'>%1$s documents</span> with our AI systems.' => 'We\'ve also generated more than <span class=\'text-primary-400\'>%1$s documents</span> with our AI systems.',
    'SpecialCharacter' => 'SpecialCharacter',
    'Kada osoba ima pitanje o svojim potrebama, proizvodima za obitelj ili o preporuci za kućnog ljubimca, AI asistent joj daje brži i jednostavniji početni odgovor. Umjesto da čeka da partner pronađe informacije ili da sama traži po internetu, odmah dobiva prijedlog proizvoda i logičan sljedeći korak.' => 'When someone has a question about their needs, products for their family or a recommendation for a pet, the AI assistant gives them a quicker, simpler initial answer. Instead of waiting for the member to find information or searching online themselves, they immediately get a product suggestion and a logical next step.',
