    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pogledaj koliko vremena i novca ulažeš” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Tvoja privatna bilješka o rasporedu i troškovima. Primjer tona: „Predugo uređujem objave pa mi ne ostane vremena javiti se ljudima kako smo dogovorili. Smanjit ću uređivanje i prvo odraditi ta javljanja.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Napravio si osobni pregled i odabrao jednu promjenu. Financijske iznose ne trebaš slati u FCC ili AI.' => 'Help the member with “Review how much time and money you invest” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: Your private note about your schedule and costs. Example tone: “I spend too long editing posts, so I don’t have time to get in touch with people as we agreed. I’ll spend less time editing and make those contacts first.” Use the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: You completed a personal review and chose one change. You do not need to send financial amounts to FCC or AI.',
