    'Kontaktni broj je promijenjen ili nije dostupan. Osvježi profil.' => 'The contact number has changed or is unavailable. Refresh the profile.',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pitaj zanima li osobu više” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Za poznanika s kojim je primjereno otvoriti temu posla; bez pretpostavke da ste već pričali o Foreveru. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], htjela sam ti spomenuti da se bavim Foreverom. Baš bih ti voljela pokazati kako to izgleda, ako te zanima. Jesi za to da se jednom kratko čujemo?” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Poslao si kratko pitanje i označio stvarno stanje: čekaš odgovor ili si ga već dobio.' => 'Help the member with “Ask if the person would like to know more” as though you are going through their day together. Example situation: An acquaintance with whom it is appropriate to bring up the business, without assuming you have already talked about Forever. Example tone: “Hi [ime], I wanted to mention that I work with Forever. I\'d love to show you what that looks like, if you\'re interested. Would you be up for a quick chat sometime?” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have sent a short question and recorded the actual status: you are waiting for an answer or have already received one.',
    'One AI per app' => 'One AI per app',
    'Product-first završetak s AI i webshopom.' => 'A product focused ending with AI and the online store.',
    'Bok! Bi li ti bilo zanimljivo čuti malo više o tome što radim s Foreverom? Mogu ti ukratko objasniti, pa vidiš zanima li te.' => 'Hi! Would you be interested in hearing a little more about what I do with Forever? I can explain it briefly, then you can see if it interests you.',
    'You are not allowed to upload files of this type.' => 'You are not allowed to upload files of this type.',
    'Kada se najviše vidi efekt' => 'When the effect is most noticeable',
    'Zamislite da s nekim razgovarate o Aloe Vera proizvodima, o zdravlju, o njezi, o poslovnoj prilici ili o tome kako gradite svoje Forever poslovanje. Umjesto da na kraju razgovora tražite Instagram, broj ili obećate poslati link kasnije, vi izvadite NFC karticu i kažete: “Slobodno približi telefon ili skeniraj kod, tu ti je sve.”' => 'Imagine talking to someone about Aloe Vera products, health, personal care, the business opportunity or how you are building your Forever business. Instead of asking for their Instagram or phone number at the end of the conversation, or promising to send a link later, you take out your NFC card and say, “Just hold your phone near it or scan the code. Everything is there.”',
