    'Upiši naziv svojeg webinara.' => 'Enter the name of your webinar.',
    'Tvoj je status utvrđen službenim FLP360 signalom 4 CC Active ili, samo kada taj signal za razdoblje nije dostupan, uključivim izračunom od najmanje 1 Personal CC i 4 Total Active CC. Personal CC već je dio Total Active CC-a i ne zbraja se ponovno. Otvori Moj Forever i pogledaj detalje.' => 'Your status is determined by the official FLP360 4 CC Active signal or, only when that period has no official signal, by the inclusive fallback of at least 1 Personal CC and 4 Total Active CC. Personal CC is already included in Total Active CC and is not added twice. Open My Forever to view the details.',
