    'Open' => 'Open',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Ponudi pomoć oko korištenja” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Dogovorena pomoć kupcu, bez dodavanja nove ponude. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], evo mene da vidim kako se snalaziš s [proizvod]. Ako ti je nešto oko korištenja nejasno, slobodno piši. Rado ću ti pokazati.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Javio si se prema dogovoru i ponudio pomoć. Nova narudžba nije dio zadatka.' => 'Help the member with “Offer help with using the product” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: Help agreed with a customer, without adding a new offer. Example tone: “Hi [ime], I\'m checking in to see how you\'re getting on with [proizvod]. If anything about using it isn\'t clear, feel free to message me. I\'d be happy to show you.” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but don\'t borrow someone else\'s story. If the member confirms they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, don\'t add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You followed up as agreed and offered help. A new order is not part of the task.',
