    'Review collaborators by period, detect traffic-quality changes, and open a detailed cockpit for deeper analysis.' => 'Review collaborators by period, detect traffic-quality changes, and open a detailed cockpit for deeper analysis.',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Sjeti se s kim bi mogao razgovarati” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Podsjetnik za budući razgovor, ne poruka za slanje. Primjer tona: „S Ivanom često pričam o poslu. Sljedeći put mogu joj spomenuti i Forever pa vidjeti zanima li je čime se bavim. Ne trebam odmah pripremiti cijelo predstavljanje.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Odabrao si jednu osobu ili pripremio objavu preko koje ti se zainteresirani mogu sami javiti.' => 'Help the member with “Think of someone you could talk to” as if you\'re going through their day together. Example situation: A reminder for a future conversation, not a message to send. Example tone: “I often talk with Ivana about work. Next time, I can mention Forever to her and see if she\'s interested in what I do. I don\'t need to prepare a full presentation right away.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used it themselves and are satisfied, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have chosen one person or prepared a post that lets interested people contact you on their own.',
