    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Objasni jednu stvar u tri koraka” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Suradniku koji te pita kako podijeliti članak sa svojim linkom. Primjer tona: „Otvori Podijeli pa odaberi članak. Prije kopiranja samo pogledaj je li na linku tvoja preporuka. Ako jest, možeš ga ubaciti u poruku. Probaj pa mi javi gdje zapneš.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš uputu koju si sam provjerio. To još ne znači da ju je netko drugi naučio.' => 'Help the member with “Explain one thing in three steps” as though you are going through their day together. Example situation: A member asks you how to share an article with their own link. Example tone: “Open Share, then choose the article. Before copying it, just check whether the link includes your referral. If it does, you can put it in a message. Give it a try and let me know where you get stuck.” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else\'s story. If the member confirms that they have used the product themselves and are satisfied, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion criterion still applies: You have instructions that you checked yourself. That does not yet mean someone else has learned how to do it.',
