    'From first interest to your own online business' => 'From first interest to your own online business',
    'Stil odgovora: "Ovdje mogu ostati samo u općim smjernicama, pa bih prvo razjasnio kontekst. Je li cilj više svakodnevna podrška i rutina ili pitate uz postojeću terapiju? Nakon toga mogu predložiti oprezan smjer kroz sastojke, rutinu i FCC članak."' => 'Assistant style: "I can only offer general guidance here, so I would first clarify the context. Is your goal more about everyday support and routine, or are you asking in connection with an existing treatment? After that, I can suggest a cautious direction based on ingredients, routine and an FCC article."',
