    'Tamarind je sastojak koji se koristi u formulama usmjerenima na bolju hidrataciju i glatkiji dojam kože. U rutini se najčešće osjeti kao ugodniji, elastičniji izgled i manje naglašene fine linije uzrokovane suhoćom.' => 'Tamarind is an ingredient used in formulas designed to improve hydration and leave skin feeling smoother. In a routine, this is most often noticeable as skin that looks more comfortable and supple, with fine lines caused by dryness appearing less pronounced.',
