    'VIP točka odluke' => 'VIP decision point',
    'Sa sponzorom uvježbaj: pitaj kupca kako mu ide. Odaberi proizvod koji poznaješ i prođite konkretno pitanje kupca. Pripremi svoj odgovor i dogovor za nastavak razgovora.' => 'Practise with your sponsor: ask a customer how things are going. Choose a product you know and go through a specific customer question together. Prepare your answer and agree on a follow up conversation.',
