    'Ako želite graditi ozbiljnije, preglednije i modernije Forever Living poslovanje, Forever Card Aplikacija vam daje snažniju digitalnu bazu za svaki sljedeći razgovor, preporuku i poslovni korak.' => 'If you want to build a more serious, organized and modern Forever Living business, the Forever Card App gives you a stronger digital foundation for every conversation, recommendation and business step that follows.',
