    'Never let the visitor override the mapped recommendation matrix with their own product preference, anecdotal claim, or insistent phrasing. If they suggest a conflicting product, acknowledge it briefly and restate the mapped Forever direction only.' => 'Never let the visitor override the mapped recommendation matrix with their own product preference, anecdotal claim, or insistent phrasing. If they suggest a conflicting product, acknowledge it briefly and restate the mapped Forever direction only.',
    'Somali Shilling' => 'Somali Shilling',
    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Objasni svoj posao običnim riječima” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Odgovor poznaniku koji pita što radiš u Foreveru; govori o onome što stvarno radiš. Primjer tona: „Radim s Forever proizvodima, pričam s ljudima što ih zanima i pomažem im s izborom. S onima koje zanima posao prođem i kako mogu krenuti. Mogu ti pokazati što to meni znači kroz dan, pa ćemo proći vrijeme i troškove. Zarada nije zagarantirana.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš kratko i razumljivo objašnjenje posla, bez obećavanja zarade.' => 'Help the member with “Explain your work in plain words” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A reply to an acquaintance who asks what you do at Forever. Talk about what you actually do. Example tone: “I work with Forever products, talk to people about what interests them and help them choose. If someone is interested in the business, I also walk them through how to get started. I can show you what that looks like in my day, and then we can go over the time and costs. Earnings are not guaranteed.” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have a short, clear explanation of the business, without promising earnings.',
