    'Objasni mi temu uz moj korak: Objasni kupcu dio upute koji mu nije jasan. Možeš li mi praktično pokazati dio uporabe koji kupcu nije jasan pa da ga objasnim svojim riječima? Želim naučiti kroz primjer i razgovor sa sponzorom ili timom.' => 'Explain the topic for my step: Explain a part of the instructions a customer doesn\'t understand. Can you show me in practice the part of using the product that the customer doesn\'t understand, so I can explain it in my own words? I want to learn through an example and a conversation with my sponsor or team.',
