    'Ova stranica je informativnog karaktera i vodi ju nezavisni Forever poslovni partner, član Forever Card Club tima. Stranica nije službena web stranica kompanije Forever Living Products. Kupnjom putem ove stranice bit ćete preusmjereni na službeni Forever Living Products web shop u vašoj zemlji, gdje vam se automatski odobrava maksimalan službeni popust. Proizvodi za osobnu njegu nisu lijekovi i ne služe za dijagnosticiranje, liječenje ili sprječavanje bolesti.' => 'This page is for informational purposes and is run by an independent Forever business partner, a member of the Forever Card Club team. This page is not the official website of Forever Living Products. When you make a purchase through this page, you will be redirected to the official Forever Living Products online store in your country, where you will automatically receive the maximum official discount. Personal care products are not medicines and are not intended to diagnose, treat or prevent disease.',
    'Baš bih ti voljela pokazati kako mi izgleda rad s Foreverom, da ne ostane sve na pričanju. Proći ćemo i vrijeme, troškove i uvjete — zarada nije zagarantirana. Onda u miru procijeniš vidiš li sebe u tome.' => 'I\'d love to show you what my work with Forever looks like, so it\'s not just talk. We\'ll go through the time involved, costs and terms too. Earnings aren\'t guaranteed. Then you can take your time deciding whether you can see yourself doing it.',
