    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Odaberi što želiš nastaviti raditi” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Tvoja bilješka o tome što želiš nastaviti raditi. Primjer tona: „Najviše mi odgovara kad odgovorim na jedno pitanje i pošaljem koristan link. To mi zvuči prirodnije nego duga poruka sa svim informacijama odjednom.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Odabrao si postupak, zapisao zašto ti koristi i što želiš sljedeće poboljšati.' => 'Help the member with “Choose what you want to keep doing” as though you were going through their day together. Example situation: Your note about what you want to keep doing. Example tone: “What works best for me is answering one question and sending a useful link. That feels more natural to me than a long message with all the information at once.” Use the warmth and way of speaking, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms that they have used it themselves and are satisfied, preserve that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add any experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions out of the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You chose a practice, recorded why it helps you and what you want to improve next.',
