    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Vježbaj slušanje prije preporuke” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Izmišljeni razgovor za vježbu slušanja, nakon što osoba kaže da želi jednostavniju rutinu. Primjer tona: „Ajde mi reci što ti je sad najviše gnjavaža u toj rutini? Aha, znači htjela bi manje koraka i da ti ne uzima puno vremena. Jesam te dobro shvatila?” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš zapisano pitanje, sažetak i provjeru razumijevanja. Ovo se vodi kao vježba.' => 'Help the member with “Practice listening before recommending” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: An imaginary conversation to practice listening, after someone says they want a simpler routine. Example tone: “Tell me, what\'s the biggest hassle in that routine right now? I see, so you\'d like fewer steps and something that doesn\'t take much time. Have I understood you correctly?” Keep the warmth and way of speaking, but don\'t borrow someone else\'s story. If the member confirms they have used it themselves and are happy with it, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, don\'t add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You\'ve written down a question, a summary and a check that you\'ve understood correctly. This counts as practice.',
