    'Radim korak „Pitaj ljude što žele znati o dodacima prehrani”. Možemo li zajedno proći ovaj primjer: Napiši naslov koji opisuje situaciju osobe, a ne samo ime proizvoda.' => 'I\'m working on the step “Ask people what they want to know about dietary supplements”. Can we go through this example together: Write a title that describes the person\'s situation, not just the product name.',
