    'Update card' => 'Update card',
    'Provjeri odgovara li na pitanje, objašnjava li razlog i ima li provjeren izvor.' => 'Check whether it answers the question, explains the reason and includes a verified source.',
    'Forever posao nije samo objaviti sliku. Treba naučiti slušati, jasno objasniti proizvod i pomoći kupcu i poslije narudžbe. Danas pokazujem jednu od tih radnji. Ako te zanima kako se to uči, mogu ti pokazati početak.' => 'The Forever business isn\'t just about posting a picture. You need to learn to listen, explain a product clearly and help the customer after an order, too. Today I\'m showing one of those activities. If you\'re interested in how to learn them, I can show you how to get started.',
    'In a few clear steps, choose whether you want to start the business, see the FCC system demo, or begin with products and a discount. Your mentor:' => 'In a few clear steps, choose whether you want to start the business, see the FCC system demo, or begin with products and a discount. Your mentor:',
    'Radim korak „Olakšaj zainteresiranoj osobi narudžbu”. Možeš mi pomoći da ovo izvedem u svojoj situaciji? Želim proći ovaj primjer: Prođi put do pregleda košarice bez dovršavanja probne kupnje i označi dva gumba koja kupac treba pronaći.' => 'I\'m working on the step “Help an interested person place an order.” Can you help me do this in my situation? I\'d like to go through this example: Follow the process as far as reviewing the cart without completing a test purchase, and identify two buttons the customer needs to find.',
    'You already have 50+ in 30 days and are in the stronger recommended sponsor zone. If you also hold 15+ in 7 days, you confirm a stable weekly rhythm.' => 'You already have 50+ in 30 days and are in the stronger recommended sponsor zone. If you also hold 15+ in 7 days, you confirm a stable weekly rhythm.',
    'In about %s day(s)' => 'In about %s day(s)',
    'Odlazni klikovi prema Forever webshopu iz tvoje FCC aplikacije.' => 'Outbound clicks toward the Forever webshop from your FCC app.',
