    'There are no pages for now' => 'There are no pages for now',
    'Odaberi jedan proizvod i pitaj tim kako ga predstavlja kupcu, što je praktično u uporabi i koja se pitanja ponavljaju. Zatim svojim riječima objasni ono što si razumio sponzoru. Osobno iskustvo uvijek pripisuješ osobi koja ga je stvarno opisala.' => 'Choose one product and ask your team how they present it to customers, what is practical about using it and which questions come up repeatedly. Then explain what you understood to your sponsor in your own words. Always attribute personal experiences to the person who actually described them.',
    'PRO omogućuje svoj naziv, temu, termin i pristupnu poveznicu te osobnu pozivnicu. Zoom ili drugu sobu suradnik kreira u tom servisu. Može dodati vlastiti video ili pozivnicu bez videa. Postojeći budući susret može urediti ili ukloniti.' => 'PRO lets a member set their own title, topic, date and time, access link and personal invitation. The member creates the Zoom meeting or other room in that service. They can add their own video or an invitation without a video. They can edit or remove an existing upcoming meeting.',
