    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Složi preporuku od pitanja do pomoći” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Cjelovita preporuka nakon stvarnog razgovora o potrebi. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], razmišljala sam o onome što si mi rekla pa bih ti pokazala [proizvod], zbog [konkretan provjeren razlog]. Šaljem ti detalje: [FCC_LINK]. Pogledaj kad stigneš, a ako želiš, mogu ti objasniti i kako se koristi.” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Preporuka ima jasnu potrebu, razlog, izvor i mogućnost pomoći. Točno je označeno je li pripremljena ili poslana.' => 'Help the member with “Put together a recommendation, from question to help” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A complete recommendation after a real conversation about a need. Example tone: “Hi [name], I’ve been thinking about what you told me, and I’d like to show you [product] because of [specific verified reason]. Here are the details: [FCC_LINK]. Take a look when you have a chance, and if you’d like, I can also explain how to use it.” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: The recommendation includes a clear need, reason, source and offer of help. It is accurately marked as prepared or sent.',
