    'Pomogni suradniku oko „Pripremi poruku za novog kupca” kao da zajedno prolazite njegov dan. Situacija primjera: Poruka koju pripremaš za kupca nakon narudžbe. Primjer tona: „Bok [ime], hvala ti na narudžbi! Kad ti stigne, slobodno mi se javi pa ti pokažem kako se koristi. Hoćeš da se i ja javim za par dana da vidim treba li ti što?” Preuzmi toplinu i način govora, ali ne tuđu priču. Ako suradnik potvrdi vlastito korištenje i zadovoljstvo, sačuvaj to iskustvo u njegovoj poruci. Bez te potvrde ne dodaj iskustvo ni oduševljenje. Upute zadrži izvan same poruke. Za završetak i dalje vrijedi: Imaš spremnu poruku s uputom, kontaktom i pitanjem o daljnjem javljanju.' => 'Help the member with “Prepare a message for a new customer” as if you were going through their day together. Example situation: A message you are preparing for a customer after an order. Example tone: “Hi [name], thanks for your order! When it arrives, feel free to get in touch and I can show you how to use it. Would you like me to check in after a few days to see if you need anything?” Take the warmth and conversational style, but not someone else’s story. If the member confirms their own use and satisfaction, keep that experience in their message. Without that confirmation, do not add personal experience or enthusiasm. Keep instructions outside the message itself. The completion requirement still applies: You have a message ready with instructions, contact details and a question about checking in again.',
